      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / CINEMATIC DRIFT PAD\n\nLong A/D/R and slow 4-second Macro8\ntransitions create evolving textures.\n\nMIDI PITCH -> MorphVCO -> StateFilter LP\nMIDI GATE -> ADSR -> VCA -> HostAudio2.\n\nMACROS: Texture, Resonance, Warmth,\nCutoff (fourth output is -5V to +5V).\nRecall snapshot A for a soft bed, then\nsnapshot B for brighter motion; LIVE to\nreturn to knob values.\n\nThis is manually morphing, not a clocked LFO.\nMonitor low output volume first.\n",
        "width": 29
      },
      "pos": [
        78,
        0
      ]
    }
